yle=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF\" title=\"挖掘艺术\"><img alt=\"挖掘艺术\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF\" title=\"挖掘艺术\">挖掘艺术</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>反时代浪潮</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：306403</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3064/306403/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">嬉皮士手记<br /><br />这真是一个可怕的地方！<br />我一点儿都不想再回忆那些事情——关于我怎样自以为逃出了小岛，又怎样重新回到了重塑之手……为了拜访海岛的哲人，我花光积蓄请人为我订制了新的衣服，以此表示尊重，但到头来我连一个酒神的信徒都没遇到！难道艺术将要迎来真正的消亡了吗？这里的人只想着怎么造出大炮和军舰，却没有人愿意停下来听我说话。<br />除此之外，还存在着更严峻的情况：即使我找到了志同道合的朋友，也无法与他们保持联系——这关乎重塑之手，他们的话语总是诱人，连我都差点迷失在那些状似美好的描述之中。<br />所幸有一位香气女士向我提供了帮助，她告诉了我一些实话，并帮助我说服了几位先生和小姐，让我的艺术能够在此地推行——好吧，即使那些家伙根本不懂艺术！<br />伟大艺术的路途总是曲折的，而前方是光明的。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"306403\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306404.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/13/Belonging-306404.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">闪光半圆仪<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Graphometer</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>闪闪发光的锡制半圆仪，其上的刻度被多方精准校对过。灵感的缪斯不会凭空产生，当测量世界的角度越大，所得的收获也会更多。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ec/Belonging-306405.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">无序圆规<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Unconventional Drawing Compass</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>相比起画出规整的圆，它的作用是提供有趣的外形，借此启发受尘世束缚的灵感。当事物被剥离创造时的作用，那时，它的艺术性才有了被探讨的价值。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/32/Belonging-306406.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“重塑之手”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Manus Vindictae\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一只无定型的手，来自更迭之处，代表了现状的另一种可能。手不光重塑了他的外表，也重塑了看待世界的方式。“涂抹一切的蓝色，全新的艺术运动！”艺术家宣告。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 第三种假设1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE1.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE1.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE1.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 第三种假设2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE2.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE2.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE2.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">第三种假设 <small style=\"color: grey\">Another Assumption</small></span></span>"}}